      "license": "Public domain",
      "artist": "National Marine Sanctuaries",
      "description": "Orcas are frequent visitors to Olympic Coast National Marine Sanctuary, where they are known to breach acrobatically like this one. Did you know that a male orca's dorsal fin can reach up to 6 feet in length, making it the longest dorsal fin of any whale?\n\nPhoto Credit: NWFSC",
